// version 1.7 BETA RELEASE March 13, 2026
// 
//  The map is incomplete, has missing trigger strings, complex narrow passages & narrow ladder openings, complex ladders, sliding pocket doors, just naming a couple of the many issues.
//  For Humans only the map issues are irrelevent & this map would be great, for bots it is a bad map due to all the issues. 
//  The maps issues, create many challenging issues, when trying to create WORKING bot files.
//  
//  THESE BOT FILES DO WORK & Bots DO complete Objectives - BUT THEY ARE BETA AND NOT RECOMENDED FOR A PUBLIC SERVER.
//  THE Custom MAPSCRIPT IS RECOMENDED - OTHERWISE ALLIES WILL NEVER - EVER - WIN
//
//  The Ladders still need tweaking. so the Most complex ladder is CLOSED to bots. Axis need Defense for Funnel Exit and needs the MOVER goal disabled.
// The Elevator is at the Top Floor but is NOT Active UNTIL the Funnel Exit is Destroyed. 
// The Old Bunker Area can NOT be destroyed UNTIL the Funnel Exit is Destroyed.
// (there is NO trigger string for the Funnel Exit Destroyed.) 
//  Axis change spawn when Funnel Exit is destroyed, a custom trigger is now in their spawn.
//  The custom triggers tells the bots their new goals because the Funnel Exit was destroyed.
// Bots know the order the objectives need to be completed in, some goals can be destroyed early but ALL Goals that bots do are REQUIRED to advance. 
//==========================================================================================
//

